ios: tap to drop deposits all in the bank

With tap-to-drop on (patch 0019), a tap on an item in the bank's side inventory deposits all of it (the inventory's
"Deposit All" op) instead of one ("Deposit 1", its first op). tapDropOption picks that entry of the same slot and
component when the top entry is one of the side inventory's own ops; the inventories of other side modals (shop,
trade: no "Deposit All" op) are unchanged, as are a long-press (the menu) and a drag. hudState() reports tapDeposit:
the side modal holds such an inventory (looked up once per side modal), for the HUD's red frame.

